    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a white rabbit finds out\u2014by accident\u2014that he\u2019s now a detective named Mr. White. Right away, he gets a strange case: to find a missing math professor, a gecko named Mr. Sturt. But things get even weirder when Mr. White finds parts of the professor\u2019s body at the crime scene\u2026 and those parts are feeling great and don\u2019t want to go back where they belong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. White\u2019s Agency</strong> is a cozy and funny detective story. It\u2019s so cozy, there\u2019s not a single murder in the whole game! Instead, you\u2019ll solve fun puzzles, talk to odd characters, and enjoy a paper theater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. White gets a case\u2014and of course, he needs your help. You move him around the map to different places, where he can talk to witnesses. You\u2019ll visit all kinds of places\u2014like tree houses, an airship home, and even the ocean floor. One chapter usually takes <strong>1\u20133 hours</strong> to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use keywords in conversations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While talking to characters, you\u2019ll find important words.\u00a0You can use these words to ask more questions and unlock more clues.\u00a0It\u2019s a loop that keeps going until you figure everything out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/95d82d06ae5e938c661d7adf71fd6fd3.poster.avif?t=1754643896\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/95d82d06ae5e938c661d7adf71fd6fd3.webm?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/95d82d06ae5e938c661d7adf71fd6fd3.mp4?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fill in your journal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the keywords you\u2019ve found to answer questions in your journal and move the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/f75c1d0948f3c2b1d0b56cb8ec7b84d0.poster.avif?t=1754643896\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/f75c1d0948f3c2b1d0b56cb8ec7b84d0.webm?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/f75c1d0948f3c2b1d0b56cb8ec7b84d0.mp4?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each location, you\u2019ll solve puzzles together to unlock new clues, meet new witnesses, and discover new keywords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/0386c6e0f8cf784272363e25a5e6ba81.poster.avif?t=1754643896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/0386c6e0f8cf784272363e25a5e6ba81.webm?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/0386c6e0f8cf784272363e25a5e6ba81.mp4?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story is all about the characters. We tried to make each one funny and memorable\u2014like Dolly the maid sheep who hates cleaning but loves pickling cabbage, Captain Hogg who always falls asleep on the job, the rude but smart gecko professor, and a surgeon praying mantis who is a little... unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, dear detectives, grab a cup of tea and follow the white rabbit! \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\ud83d\udc07\u2615</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a white rabbit finds out\u2014by accident\u2014that he\u2019s now a detective named Mr. White. Right away, he gets a strange case: to find a missing math professor, a gecko named Mr. Sturt. But things get even weirder when Mr. White finds parts of the professor\u2019s body at the crime scene\u2026 and those parts are feeling great and don\u2019t want to go back where they belong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. White\u2019s Agency</strong> is a cozy and funny detective story. It\u2019s so cozy, there\u2019s not a single murder in the whole game! Instead, you\u2019ll solve fun puzzles, talk to odd characters, and enjoy a paper theater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. White gets a case\u2014and of course, he needs your help. You move him around the map to different places, where he can talk to witnesses. You\u2019ll visit all kinds of places\u2014like tree houses, an airship home, and even the ocean floor. One chapter usually takes <strong>1\u20133 hours</strong> to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use keywords in conversations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While talking to characters, you\u2019ll find important words.\u00a0You can use these words to ask more questions and unlock more clues.\u00a0It\u2019s a loop that keeps going until you figure everything out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/95d82d06ae5e938c661d7adf71fd6fd3.poster.avif?t=1754643896\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/95d82d06ae5e938c661d7adf71fd6fd3.webm?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/95d82d06ae5e938c661d7adf71fd6fd3.mp4?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fill in your journal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the keywords you\u2019ve found to answer questions in your journal and move the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/f75c1d0948f3c2b1d0b56cb8ec7b84d0.poster.avif?t=1754643896\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/f75c1d0948f3c2b1d0b56cb8ec7b84d0.webm?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/f75c1d0948f3c2b1d0b56cb8ec7b84d0.mp4?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each location, you\u2019ll solve puzzles together to unlock new clues, meet new witnesses, and discover new keywords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/0386c6e0f8cf784272363e25a5e6ba81.poster.avif?t=1754643896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/0386c6e0f8cf784272363e25a5e6ba81.webm?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403850/extras/0386c6e0f8cf784272363e25a5e6ba81.mp4?t=1754643896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story is all about the characters. We tried to make each one funny and memorable\u2014like Dolly the maid sheep who hates cleaning but loves pickling cabbage, Captain Hogg who always falls asleep on the job, the rude but smart gecko professor, and a surgeon praying mantis who is a little... unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, dear detectives, grab a cup of tea and follow the white rabbit! \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\ud83d\udc07\u2615</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
